window.products.push({"id":98052,"name":"Kenmore 60505 18 cu. ft. Top Freezer Refrigerator with Glass Shelves in Stainless Steel, includes delivery and hookup","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/41NDoqvxflL._AC_SL1200_.jpg","description":"Keep your refrigerated and frozen food items at the correct temperature with the Kenmore 18-Cubic Feet Top Freezer and Refrigerator. This Kenmore top freezer refrigerator has 18 cubic feet of interior space, perfect for stocking up on snacks, leftovers, lunches and cans of soda for the home or office. Keep delicious leftovers right next to lunch bags and other groceries, and stash crisp produce in the humidity controlled crisper. Features full-width adjustable glass shelves and 2 clear plastic crisper drawers for fresh and crisp fruits and vegetables. The refrigerator features slide-out glass storage shelves for easy access and removal of pies, cakes, casseroles, and larger food items. With the adjustable shelving, you get near-limitless interior organization options. With the convenient door storage there’s no more trying to puzzle out how to fit food in the fridge. Gallon door bins make it easy to store tall items and beverages alongside your favorite sauces, dressings and other ingredients. Tall item accommodation on the bottom shelf means more space for bottles of wine and water; no more trying to shove things wherever they'll fit. The roomy freezer can hold all of your frozen food neatly. No more digging through a pile of frozen food for a bag of peas. This Kenmore frost-free top freezer helps you keep foods nice and organized with two door bins and a single shelf. Features a clean back design that hides the condenser coils, preventing the accumulation of dust and providing you with better refrigerating performance. Kenmore recommends measuring your space to ensure the freezer/refrigerator combo will fit. Freezer does not have an icemaker. DIMENSIONS: 32. 63\" x 29. 88\" x 66. 13\" STORAGE SPACE: 18 cubic feet of interior storage space COLOR: Stainless Steel.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/41NDoqvxflL._AC_SL1200_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Kenmore","source_asin":"B073RM388H","category_path":"Home & Appliances"},"sku":"BM-98052","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B073RM388H","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Appliances.jsonl","source_asin":"B073RM388H","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
