window.products.push({"id":98054,"name":"8269145 2-Pack Undercounter Dishwasher Mounting Bracket Replacement with Screws for Whirlpool, Compatible for Sears, Kenmore, Amana, Jenn-Air, Crosley","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61z4NB7DupL._AC_SL1001_.jpg","description":"Comparable to OEM Parts include WP8269145, 8269145, EA393134, AP3039168, PS393134, 830941, AH393134 and many more. INSTRUCTIONS: 1) Turn off power to your dishwasher in breaker box (ABSOLUTELY CRITICAL TO AVOID SHOCK) and water supply to your dishwasher.  2) Open the dishwasher front door and remove screws holding dishwasher to counter. 3) Close the dishwasher door and pull the dishwasher out from the counter to see the existing brackets if they exist. You may need to lower the dishwasher by adjusting the levelling feet.  4) Remove existing brackets by bending metal tab using pliers and pulling them out from dishwasher frame.  5) Insert the rear end of the new bracket into the dishwasher frame and then bend the tabs on the end of each bracket upwards to secure them in place and to prevent the brackets from sliding back out. Slide the dishwasher back beneath the counter. 6) With the front door open, drive a screw through each bracket into the countertop above.  ALL SET! WHAT YOU GET: 2 x Dishwasher Mounting Brackets 2 x Mounting Screws 100% CUSTOMER SATISFACTION Feel free to contact us if you have any questions or problems with the item sold by Geengle.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61z4NB7DupL._AC_SL1001_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Geengle","source_asin":"B07D7HS3KW","category_path":"Home & Appliances"},"sku":"BM-98054","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07D7HS3KW","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Appliances.jsonl","source_asin":"B07D7HS3KW","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
