window.products.push({"id":98112,"name":"Whynter MIM-14231SS 14'' Undercounter Automatic Stainless Steel Marine 23lb Daily Output Ice Makers, One Size","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":933.92,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81qnCYejTML._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Specifically designed and engineered for boats, yachts, and RVs, the Whynter MIM-14231SS 14\" Undercounter Automatic Stainless Steel Marine Ice Maker is the answer to your mobile ice making requirements. With a full stainless steel housing and marine-grade components, this heavy-duty and robust ice maker produces an impressive 23 lbs of ice per day and is able to hold up to 12 lbs of ice. Aiming to conserve space with a stylish look, the 14-inch width makes this ideal for in-cabinet installation with no additional clearance required around the sides. The front-venting design allows you to install this stainless steel ice maker under a counter or in-cabinet for a seamless appearance. Featuring high grade stainless steel and hardware components that are UV and corrosion-resistant the unit will have superior durability in harsh environments. The ice maker also comes standard with a 6 foot highly durable braided stainless steel waterline connection hose. The Whynter MIM-14231SS can be reversed to open from either the left or right to complement the flow of your space design. The Whynter MIM-14231SS is equipped with a latch-lock that keeps the door securely closed under various mobile conditions while allowing easy access when required. Using less than 3 gallons of water to produce 23 lbs of ice a day, the ice maker is ideal for mobile use. Additionally, melted ice is recycled into new ice and no drain is required, allowing for fast and convenient installation in most spaces.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81qnCYejTML._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Whynter","source_asin":"B01EYJDCWK","category_path":"Home & Appliances"},"sku":"BM-98112","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B01EYJDCWK","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Appliances.jsonl","source_asin":"B01EYJDCWK","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":98113,"name":"Countertop Ice Maker Machine – 9 Ice Cubes Ready in 6 Mins - 26LBS/24Hrs, LED Indicator Lights – Compact Portable Ice Cube Maker with Ice Scoop and Ba","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":129.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61m8j15SnvL._SL1500_.jpg","description":"DESIGNED TO MAKE PERFECT ICE FAST - Caynel Ice Maker works quickly making 9 chewable delicious bullet-shaped ice-cubes in one cycle in just 6 minutes—and up to 26 lbs of ice per day. Two selectable ice cube sizes making it perfect for mixed drinks or small water bottle openings. INTELLIGENT FEATURES - Quickly respond to your every tap of corresponding button on operation area. Our ice maker prevents overflowing with warning lights and an automatic shut-off feature for when the ice basket is full or if water needs to be refilled, so as to reduce mistakes and protect device itself to prolong life span. Press and hold the power button 3 seconds to enter the automatic cleaning function. COMPACT & PORTABLE - Measuring at 10.3 x 14.4 x 13 inches, the compact ice maker will take minimal counter top area while bringing practical functions to you. It is ideal to use indoors or outdoors for parties and events. Monitor the ice producing situation by the transparent viewing window and use 1.5 lbs removable ice basket and ice scoop to remove ice, providing a great convenience for you. QUIET & ENERGY EFFICIENT - Electric ice maker is made to be chill it runs at a mellow and efficient 120 watts with a quiet cooling function Its 2-liter/68 oz. water reservoir sits below the ice basket letting your ice maker reuse water from melted ice to make new ice— giving you best-in-class ease-of-use and energy efficient. WARRANTY & SUPPORT - Made from food grade materials, offers healthy ice cubes for you. Durable ABS surface is smooth and smudge-resistant. ETL approved with advanced safety technology for long lasting durability, 1-year warranty provided by Caynel, so you can purchase worry-free - we've got your back!","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61m8j15SnvL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"CAYNEL","source_asin":"B099WCD5GH","category_path":"Home & Appliances"},"sku":"BM-98113","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B099WCD5GH","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Appliances.jsonl","source_asin":"B099WCD5GH","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
