window.products.push({"id":98183,"name":"3387747 WP3387747 Dryer Heating Element Kit-Compatible With Whirlpool Cabrio Kenmore He2 Kenmore Elite He3 Maytag Dryers- GEW9250PW0 GEQ9800PW1 WD05X3","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":26.69,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71gUzaW8UBL._AC_SL1434_.jpg","description":"✅【SUPERIOR PERFORMANCE MATERIALS】Our wp3387747 dryer heating element is made with high-quality nickel-chromium (Ni-Cr) content coil and galvanized steel support, ensuring quick and even heating, high anti-corrosion, and durability. With a spiral tight design that is 30% longer than other dryer coils, it increases resistance by more than 70%, providing high performance with low power consumption. ✅【HIGH COMPATIBILITY】Our upgraded wp3387747 dryer heating element is compatible with a wide range of dryers, including Kenmore Elite HE3, Kenmore HE2, Kenmore Elite HE4, Whirlpool Cabrio, Maytag, Crosley, and Inglis. It also works with models such as gew9250pw0, wd05x30818, geq9800pw2, 6em40-d, e330485, medb835dw4, wed8300sw2, gew9250pw1, gew9200lw1, wed8000dw4, wed5500xw0, ffre4120sw2, ge20p06sag, med5500fw2, wed92hefbd2, wed92hefc2, wed92hefu2, wed92hefw2, ywed8000dw4, and ywed85hefc2. ✅【VALUE COMBO PACK】Our geq9800pw2 heating element kit bundle includes not just one heating element, but also a WP3392519 thermal fuse, a 279816 thermostat kit, a 279973 thermal cut-off fuse kit, and an 8577274 dryer thermistor. With this package, you can easily fix common dryer problems such as no heat or not enough heat, takes too long to dry clothes, shuts off too soon, and timer not advancing. We recommend watching a few YouTube videos to help with taking things apart, but it's relatively easy. ✅【PERFECT REPLACEMENT】Our WP3387747 dryer heating element is a perfect replacement for AP6008281, 8527865, AP6008325, PS11741416, 80003, 3387747, W11045584, W11344457, WP3387747VP, 525502, and EAP11741416. The 279816 thermal fuse and thermostat kit replaces 279816, AP3094244, 279816VP, 3399848, PS334299, 2651, and 3977393. The 279973 thermal fuse and thermostat replaces 279973VP, 3391913, 3404151, 3404152, 3977395, 897710, and AP3094323. The 3392519 thermal fuse replaces WP3392519, 694511, 3388651, ET401, AP6008325, AP3132867, PS11741460, and PS345113. ✅【180 DAYS WARRANTY】-TOMOON provides a 180-days warranty for all customers. We offer a simple, streamlined shopping experience for large appliance replacement parts and prove that we have the highest quality parts and service out there. If you have any quality problems with our ap6008281 dryer heating element during the warranty period (180 DAYS FREE GUARANTEE), please contact TOMOON customer service team in time, and we'll try our best to solve your problems.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71gUzaW8UBL._AC_SL1434_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"TOMOON","source_asin":"B08QM8WTK5","category_path":"Home & Appliances"},"sku":"BM-98183","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B08QM8WTK5","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Appliances.jsonl","source_asin":"B08QM8WTK5","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
