window.products.push({"id":98246,"name":"30 Inch Built In Gas Cooktop, thermomate Gas Range top with 5 High Efficiency SABAF Burners, 304 Stainless Steel Gas Stove with Flame Out Protection, ","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":389.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71w5CeCv3gL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"2nd GENERATION ITALY SABAF BURNERS: Adopt Italy 2nd generation SABAF burners, the precise flame control system offers stable flame, with 1x13,000-BTU wok burner, 1x10,300-BTU rapid burner, 2x7,000-BTU semi-rapid burner, 1×4,000-BTU auxiliary burner, each burner distribute even heat to meet a variety of cooking demand. Such as simmer, fry, stir-frying, roast, steaming, boil, melting, or caramelizing. 2 SAFETY PROTECTIONS: The ignition is controlled by a push-type rotary switch which can prevent accidental touch by children. What's more, being equipped with a thermocouple flameout protection technology (FFD) ensures the gas is automatically turned off when no flame is detected, to keep your family safe. 1 MINUTE TO CLEAN UP: 0.03-inch thickness #304 stainless steel integrally molded panel and sealed burner designed for effortless cleanup and maintenance, the gasket under the knob can keep the food residue away. What's more, the combo heavy-duty dishwasher-safe cast-iron grates are machine washable. 5 MINUTES TO INSTALL: Please verify the gas hob is the right size for you. Product size: 30” W × 20.08” D × 1.67” H, cut out size: 28.58” W × 18.93” D. 120V AC pulse ignition with 3.9 feet (1.2 m) power cord for quick connection. NOTE: the gas pressure regulator included is for NG use only. 2 GAS SUPPLY OPTIONS: The gas cooktop stove delivers the maximum 42,500BTU power to natural gas ( Preinstalled for NG) and liquid propane gas(LPG Conversion Kit included), you can choose either gas supply as you like. Capable for multi-purpose such as big kitchen, mobile home, cooking lover family, etc.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71w5CeCv3gL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"thermomate","source_asin":"B0BQD5NDGR","category_path":"Home & Appliances"},"sku":"BM-98246","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0BQD5NDGR","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Appliances.jsonl","source_asin":"B0BQD5NDGR","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
