window.products.push({"id":98324,"name":"BREWRITE # 4 Coffee 3pk x 100 Filters Each, 300 Count, Brown","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":39.49,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/91oXAv77kBL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"The natural brew story: after more than 20 years in the coffee business, two things still bothered me. One, Coffee filters were bleached with white chemicals, and two, They were very hard to separate. Then, a few years ago, I began working with one of America's most respected Coffee producers to develop a new kind of filter. A natural Brown filter that hasn't been bleached white. Since they are made with only the finest of papers, they're easy to separate. The end of Two of life's little frustrations. So there you have it. The new Brown filter We call natural brew. These filters have countless other great uses including: serving snacks, craft projects, cleaning windows and glassware, and more!","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/91oXAv77kBL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Brew Rite","source_asin":"B07XCWJ3WH","category_path":"Home & Appliances"},"sku":"BM-98324","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07XCWJ3WH","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Appliances.jsonl","source_asin":"B07XCWJ3WH","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":98325,"name":"FOOING Countertop Ice Maker, Portable Ice Maker Machine, 33lbs/Day & 6 Mins 9 Bullet Ice, 2L Tank Ice Maker Counter Top with LED Display, Auto-Cleanin","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":109.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61JljU2CwiL._SL1500_.jpg","description":"🍹【Quiet & Efficient Ice Making】 This efficient ice maker can produce 9 ice cubes for one cycle within only 6 mins, with a maximum of 33 pounds per day. There is no need to worry about running out of ice cubes. Also, our ice maker is not only excellent in refrigeration, but also at less than 45db normal noise, ensuring a comfortable and quiet environment to enjoy ice-making, similar to a working freezer. 🍹【Compact Design & Bullet Ice Making】 This portable ice maker has a wide range of applications and a compact size of 8.7×12.2×12.6inches, 17Ib. The small size makes it very easy to carry. The ice maker countertop comes with an ice basket and ice scoop for easy ice storage. FOOING ice maker produces beautiful bullet ice with two size, which is best suited for soft drinks,mixed drinks such as wine,cocktails, sodas, ice coffee, watermelon and other beverages and foods. 🍹【Easy-to-operate Control Panel】 The ice maker has an easy-to-use control panel with 0.5-19.5hour timing, ON/OFF button, automatic self-cleaning, ice full and water shortage indication, which makes it easier for you to operate. Besides, the transparent lid allows you to monitor the ice capacity. Only need to add water to the tank and Press the CLEAN button for 5 seconds to start the self-cleaning process.This function makes cleaning a breeze and greatly simplifies daily maintenance. 🍹【 Save Money & Widely Used】 No need to waste time to shop and saving up to 80% of money on ice cubes every day. This bullet ice maker produces 9pcs of fresh ice in 6 mins and has a ice scoop/basket. Take it out about 1-2 hours when gets full, transfer the ice to a bag or bin and place it in freezer. Our ice machines not only save water, but also use widely, which perfect for kitchen, office, bar, camping, RV, or parties, a perfect Christmas gift for your friend who like chilled beverages. 🍹【Warranty Promise & 7*24 After-sale Service】 Nobody can stand a scorching summer without ice. Keeping food fresh, creating cold drinks, chilling beers, and champagne, it all comes true with an ice maker. Our Mission is committed to providing customers with premium FOOING ice maker at a reasonable price. We offer ① 12-month warranty from the original purchase date; ② Lifetime technical service support. Suppose you have any questions, our 7*24-hour customer support is always ready to help you!","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61JljU2CwiL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"FOOING","source_asin":"B0C9MGFHWY","category_path":"Home & Appliances"},"sku":"BM-98325","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0C9MGFHWY","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Appliances.jsonl","source_asin":"B0C9MGFHWY","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
