window.products.push({"id":98391,"name":"COSTWAY Portable Countertop Dishwasher, Compact Dishwasher with 7.5 L Built-in Water Tank, 360° Dual Spray Arms, 5 Washing Programs, Air-Dry Function,","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/618zV2ncctL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"💦7.5 L OPENABLE BUILT-IN WATER TANK------There are 2 water supply options for the countertop dishwasher. It can link directly with the faucet through inject hose, or pump the water from the 7.2L built-in water tank. In that case, you don’t need a spare sink or extra countertop area for dishwasher. More conveniently, the water tank and the 3-layer filter are detachable and open for daily cleaning and maintenance. 💦360° DOUBLE SPRAY ARMS FOR EFFECTIVE RINSING------Top and lower spray arms of the portable dishwasher can swivel 360 °and rinses off various degrees of the stain from all angles. The compact dishwasher has a total of 22 water ports to provide powerful water spray, convenience for cleaning pots and pans and single serve dishes. There is a designated spot for you to place a cleaning tablet or you can just throw the dishwasher powder into the machine. 💦5 WASHING PROGRAMS & CHILD LOCK FUNCTION------The countertop dishwasher has 5 built-in washing programs to tackle your dirty dish, based on the different tableware material and stains to ensure the optimum cleaning results. The portable dishwasher also has a child lock function for babies and pet-proof. And if you open the door during its function, the program will shut down automatically for safety using. 💦HOT AIR DRY & 24 H PRESERVE FUNCTION------After each round of washing, the dishwasher's hot air dry function will dry your tableware with 142 °F of circulation and sterilize as well as disinfect the dish at the same time. The dishwasher also has 24-hour preservation, where the hot air function automatically turns on every 3 hours and makes the dish load dry and fresh. 💦COMPACT SIZE & LARGE CAPACITY------This compact dishwasher measures 17.8” x 16.2” x 19.3” (W x D x H), and yet has a sufficient 2 place setting with a cutlery basket for an aggregate amount of 28 pieces of tableware. The small dishwasher is an ideal kitchen appliance for small apartments, dorms as well as RVs with low noise of 58db. This dishwasher is applicable for ceramic, glass, and stainless steel tableware.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/618zV2ncctL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"COSTWAY","source_asin":"B09DT26XF6","category_path":"Home & Appliances"},"sku":"BM-98391","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B09DT26XF6","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Appliances.jsonl","source_asin":"B09DT26XF6","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
