window.products.push({"id":98857,"name":"Bamboo Coffee Organizer Stand, Compatible with c hemex Coffee Makers, Coffee Filter Holder with Silicone Dripper Mat, Pour Over Coffee Maker Caddy Fit","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":36.89,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71y+IHzW52L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"NEAT DESKTOP--Our filter holder helps you organize your messy desktop, making it the perfect space saver for your kitchen and office areas. This coffee stand is compatible with c hemex coffee machines, and you can place a few other things on it to keep your counter clean and tidy and keep you in a good mood throughout the day. UPGRADED PERFORMANCE - The latest c hemex caddies are designed not just for looks, but more for utility. The coffee stand has three compartments, the first one is to place the coffee pot, and the coffee filter can be placed in the middle; different from other styles, the third compartment is added, Can put some other items on the table. Simple and stylish in appearance, the natural tones of bamboo and wood can be perfectly coordinated in your office area or bedroom kitchen. NATURAL MATERIAL - The material of the filter holder is made from 100% recycled bamboo. This natural bamboo is non-toxic and original, it is your first choice for healthy life. NEW GIFTS - If your friends are frustrated with messy desks every day, it's time to surprise your friends with a c hemex organizer as a holiday gift. If you happen to be a lover of c hemex coffee pots, the cofee filter holder will be the perfect home for your coffee pot and provide effective protection. THE BEST SERVICE--if you have any problems with our c hemex caddy, you can contact us at any time, we are very happy to help you solve the problem and will reply to your questions as soon as possible.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71y+IHzW52L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"AYUSEB","source_asin":"B0BWTL6C1Z","category_path":"Home & Appliances"},"sku":"BM-98857","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0BWTL6C1Z","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Appliances.jsonl","source_asin":"B0BWTL6C1Z","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
